title: Cairn
abstract: >-
  A decentralized, model-agnostic, distributed detection-and-analysis engine:
  volunteers lend their own AI to collectively notice harm and route it to the
  institutions that can act. Mission-neutral; runs many causes on one protocol,
  with cross-model verification, human-in-the-loop vetting, and a tamper-evident
  transparency log.
